  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.HoloOASIS v2.0.4\n\nConnects the OASIS to Holochain -- a post-blockchain, agent-centric distributed computing framework enabling truly P2P applications without global consensus. Each agent runs their own chain; data is shared on a DHT. HoloOASIS is the original OASIS decentralised backend, storing holons and avatars directly on the Holochain DHT via HoloNET. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.3\n- feat: complete Edge offline runtime and release automation (279c090)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Network/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.HoloOASIS",
